Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.08,0:00:18.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our crowd goes away the second we take a break...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.00,0:00:20.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei, do you have any tips\Nfor how to keep it going?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.38,0:00:24.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You have to take care of yourself,\Nand that means taking breaks.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.71,0:00:25.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,We're gonna take five!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:27.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,The crowd leaves because their time is limited,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:27.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,We're gonna take five!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.04,0:00:29.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,and they want pictures of other cosplayers.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.50,0:00:32.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You have to convince them you're worth waiting for.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.96,0:00:36.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, we'll be ready again in a second!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.25,0:00:37.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.21,0:00:39.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll wait as long as\NI need to get a good pic of you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.00,0:00:41.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Take your time!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.25,0:00:45.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is one of the troubles\Nwith larger cosplay groups.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.92,0:00:52.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Miss Liliel's strength is her infinite number of poses,\Nbut her groupmates can't match that.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.75,0:00:57.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here, with her group,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.50,0:01:00.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,she can't use any of her strengths\Nto their collective advantage.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.50,0:02:47.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Was coming as a full group a bad idea?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.54,0:02:52.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, we wouldn't get this much\Nattention without the full group.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.54,0:02:55.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a way we can make this work!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.29,0:02:57.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa-chan.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.63,0:03:03.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just tell me what pose to do.\NThat's the only way we'll get more people!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.71,0:03:07.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can, but Mikari-chan and Aria-chan\Nwon't be able to keep up...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.04,0:03:12.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I wouldn't know what scene\Nor pose you're even talking about.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.96,0:03:17.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa and Nono-pi would be so much better\Noff without me holding them back...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.63,0:03:20.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, am I the one ruining this for them?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.50,0:03:26.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay! I'll try harder!\NThis was all my idea, after all!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.46,0:03:29.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, then what should I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.46,0:03:34.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Love the positivity,\Nbut how are you gonna 'try harder'?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.79,0:03:38.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on.\NRirisa-chan, did you drink any water yet?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.92,0:03:42.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.13,0:03:46.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel wouldn't drink regular bottled water...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.08,0:03:47.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.08,0:03:52.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I don't want to mess up my makeup,\Nso I used a lot of powder to stop me from sweating.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.04,0:03:53.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Come on, Ririsa-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.58,0:03:56.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know, but I've been the\Nperfect Liliel all day today!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.00,0:03:57.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't stop now!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.50,0:04:00.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's perfectionism and then\Nthere's being ridiculous!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.21,0:04:01.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hydrate, now!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.46,0:04:09.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know this is overkill,\Nbut this is the way I have to cosplay.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.21,0:04:10.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.08,0:04:11.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.04,0:04:17.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I like Ririsa's take on cosplay.\NWe should let her do whatever she thinks is right.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.29,0:04:18.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria-chan...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.92,0:04:20.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.71,0:04:23.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna drink water, either.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.46,0:04:26.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to try doing this your way, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.83,0:04:28.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,B-but, that's crazy!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.29,0:04:32.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,My idea of perfection is seriously ridiculous.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.75,0:04:35.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I couldn't make someone else,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.13,0:04:37.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,let alone one of my friends,\Ntry to match me.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.54,0:04:40.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're kinda just doing your own thing, then...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.29,0:04:43.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.13,0:04:46.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, you've gotta talk to Ririsa...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.17,0:04:48.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I heard the whole thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.25,0:04:52.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I already came with a plan for\NRirisa's dedication to perfection.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.00,0:04:56.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,So I brought the mythril bento box set\NLiliel used in the manga!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.71,0:04:57.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's got a water bottle!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.96,0:04:58.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.04,0:05:00.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel can drink out of that, yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.75,0:05:06.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,But Senpai, it's an unopened box!\NAnd it's super rare...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.83,0:05:10.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yup. They only ever made five sets!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.63,0:05:11.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.67,0:05:13.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-so that's one of five?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.42,0:05:14.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be worth something!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.67,0:05:16.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,A-are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.92,0:05:21.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Any real otaku would be happy to\Nhave Liliel use his rare treasure.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.29,0:05:22.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.92,0:05:26.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was suave enough to\Nmake me forget how weird he is.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.25,0:05:31.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at that Liliel.\NShe's drinking from the mythril bottle.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.83,0:05:35.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Damn... And she's staying completely in character!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.17,0:05:37.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,The real Liliel is here with us...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.79,0:05:40.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Listen up, Autobots.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.33,0:05:42.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.29,0:05:44.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's a death flag, Optimus.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.38,0:05:48.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're ready for photos!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.50,0:05:54.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're all looking in the same direction!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.88,0:05:56.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,If we can't sync our poses,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.33,0:05:58.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,then we can at least get\Nthem looking the same way!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.71,0:06:00.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll be their target.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.00,0:06:02.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look right at me!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.29,0:06:05.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're looking my way!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.79,0:06:12.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Their crowd's getting big again.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.17,0:06:14.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good for them! I love having competition.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.54,0:06:19.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Same, but it's really starting to get hot...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.54,0:06:22.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Let's rest a little longer.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.25,0:06:23.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.92,0:06:25.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know things are going well,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.38,0:06:28.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,but you need to make\Nsure they're taking water breaks!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.25,0:06:29.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,G-got it.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.17,0:06:32.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel! Break time!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.25,0:06:40.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,If we can't do more poses,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.08,0:06:43.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,then I have to make sure\Nevery tiny detail is perfect.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.00,0:06:46.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Damn...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.08,0:06:49.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that Liliel is incredible.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.63,0:06:51.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's in a class of her own.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.42,0:06:55.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can we post pics of them?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.92,0:06:58.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they said that's cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.04,0:07:00.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,These are gonna turn out great...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.00,0:07:05.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is just Day One. I've gotta work harder.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.63,0:07:14.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,At the very least,\NI have to make sure my cosplay is perfect...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.54,0:07:16.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.38,0:07:24.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nonopi! You okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.29,0:07:26.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.00,0:07:27.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa, break time!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.75,0:07:32.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa-chan, are you okay?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.08,0:07:38.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-sorry, I got light-headed...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.33,0:07:41.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel?! What happened?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.75,0:07:44.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did she pass out? Did she hit her head?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.38,0:07:46.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I caught her.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.58,0:07:47.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.79,0:07:52.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,She might have heatstroke.\NLet's get her inside where it's cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.04,0:07:54.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then we'll see how she's feeling\Nand visit the first aid station.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.75,0:07:59.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can you walk? We have to get you inside.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.92,0:08:04.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is she okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.21,0:08:05.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Anyone see a staffer?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.29,0:08:07.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei, I've got her.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.58,0:08:10.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could you help me lift her?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.54,0:08:27.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself!\NWe don't want you to pass out, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.46,0:08:29.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nonoa-chan...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.96,0:08:34.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I will protect you with my life.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.54,0:08:36.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nokiel...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.96,0:08:45.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's the real Nokiel.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.88,0:08:47.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dude!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.21,0:08:52.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's just a little heat exhaustion.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.42,0:09:00.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're feeling better and drinking water,\Nbut you should go home and rest to be safe.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.33,0:09:02.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.08,0:09:03.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,No buts!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.25,0:09:04.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's right, Ririsa-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.71,0:09:06.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.00,0:09:11.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ariel wouldn't let her friend\NLiliel push herself too hard.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.83,0:09:17.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.63,0:09:22.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mita, you see Liliel yet?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.46,0:09:25.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I saw some of Mikarin,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.29,0:09:28.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,but for some reason,\NI haven't seen anything since this morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.17,0:09:31.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.71,0:09:36.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Real twin cosplayers aim for the Heavenly Seat.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.25,0:09:40.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lemon and Lime draw biggest crowd of Day 1.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.33,0:09:43.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi's industry booth appearance\Ndraws her biggest crowd yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.88,0:09:48.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,No Mayura-sama this year...\NAre Lemon/Lime next up for Queen?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.58,0:09:54.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Day 1 is over, hottest temperatures\Never cause exhaustion, heatstroke...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.50,0:10:03.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The vibes are so off.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.17,0:10:06.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, what do we do tomorrow?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.33,0:10:08.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're going if Ririsa feels better, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.54,0:10:10.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.63,0:10:17.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry about today. It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.54,0:10:22.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,How is it your fault?\NLiterally anyone could've passed out in that heat.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.17,0:10:27.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I should've prepped better! I-I know it's my fault!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.63,0:10:29.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll do better tomorrow, promise!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.83,0:10:34.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll come up with something. You guys just relax!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.46,0:10:40.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,If anyone should be relaxing, it's you!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.21,0:10:41.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.00,0:10:43.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-it's okay, Mikarin...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.29,0:10:55.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,N-Nonoa-chan?!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.92,0:10:57.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop it, okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.71,0:10:59.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,"I'll think of something."
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.25,0:11:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,"I'll do better."
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.00,0:11:02.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,"I couldn't force you."
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.88,0:11:04.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,"You guys relax."
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.42,0:11:07.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop doing everything yourself!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.13,0:11:12.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You said you'd be my friend, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.08,0:11:15.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,So let me help!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.38,0:11:21.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get it, you're just being nice.\NBut, you're nice to everyone!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.88,0:11:26.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,So what's the point of being friends,\Nif you're just gonna treat us like everyone else?!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.71,0:11:28.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't have to do this by yourself!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.25,0:11:33.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tell us what you're thinking.\NTell us what you want to do!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.21,0:11:38.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I might not be able to do that,\Nand I might think it's a pain...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.42,0:11:43.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I still want you to ask me!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.33,0:11:50.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I don't want to do it, or if I can't do it, I'll tell you.\NDon't make assumptions for me!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.58,0:11:56.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not when I finally have the\Ncourage to tell you how I feel!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.88,0:12:02.88,Q7,,0,0,0,,The local train bound for Hiyoshi is approaching on Track 2.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.96,0:12:08.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get it. You know how much easier\Nit is to do things by yourself.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.88,0:12:13.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everything is easier when you don't have friends.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.00,0:12:16.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about\Nanyone else other than yourself.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.75,0:12:20.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's easy, but it kills you inside.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.54,0:12:23.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I felt so alone today.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.21,0:12:28.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to be friends! Allies!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.58,0:12:32.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,So let me sacrifice all I have to help win the battle!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.58,0:12:34.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nonoa-chan...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.83,0:12:38.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not about to like, sacrifice myself,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.54,0:12:41.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I totally agree with her on everything else.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.79,0:12:45.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure, it was intense,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.04,0:12:47.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,but isn't this the kind of\Nfriendship you want right now?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.54,0:12:51.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikari-chan, Aria-chan...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.13,0:12:54.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's do this together, Ririsa!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.33,0:12:59.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not made of free time,\Nso start telling me what to do, okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.13,0:13:01.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna half-ass anything,\Nwhether it's modeling or cosplaying.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.29,0:13:15.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, next pose!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.79,0:13:17.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dance practice, you think?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.79,0:13:19.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're so cute.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.79,0:13:21.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is the Lord Ashford pose!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.71,0:13:25.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Perfect, Nokiel!\NAriel, move your elbow a little to the left!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.50,0:13:28.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Miriella, your arm should be at a thirty-degree angle.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.08,0:13:31.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't go too hard just 'cause it's cooling off, okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.96,0:13:41.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's all 50 of the big poses.\NI want you guys to memorize them by tomorrow!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.92,0:13:43.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.88,0:13:47.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll try.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.25,0:13:48.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.33,0:13:51.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you can remember all those,\NI should at least try.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.96,0:13:56.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa remembers them because she loves the manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.92,0:13:58.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,It might be easier for you guys\Nto memorize them with the story.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.08,0:14:01.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like the poses from Volume 1\Nagainst their first enemy.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.21,0:14:04.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then they get their new attack in Volume 2.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.46,0:14:07.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's stronger and flashier,\Nhence the bigger pose.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.88,0:14:11.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the part during our watch party where\NRirisa spilled soda everywhere.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.13,0:14:16.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's easier to remember when\Nyou associate them with certain parts.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.38,0:14:20.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even if you forget the names for stuff,\Nyou'll still remember the big scenes.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.33,0:14:25.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you do your poses in story order,\Nyou should hit them all without faltering.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.63,0:14:28.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,And then I won't have to tell\Nyou which one to do next!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.63,0:14:31.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll put together the ordered\Nlist while you guys practice.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.63,0:14:33.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Awesome, thank you so much!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.75,0:14:39.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's it! Wow, everyone looks perfect!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.04,0:14:42.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again from the top!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.38,0:14:47.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Isn't that your phone, Nonopi? It keeps going off.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.29,0:14:49.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?! It's probably my Mom.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.54,0:14:54.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's follower notifications...\NAnd they just keep coming!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.63,0:14:58.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What did I do?!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.21,0:15:01.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, whoa...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.29,0:15:05.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,That picture went crazy viral!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.96,0:15:08.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,So that's why my notifications are popping off...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.13,0:15:26.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Damn, everyone says they're gonna come see us!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.83,0:15:31.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've got a chance to redeem yourself,\Nall thanks to Nonoa.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.42,0:15:33.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.54,0:15:41.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, we're gonna bring out\Nthe best cosplay ever, as a team!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.00,0:15:43.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, circle up!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.33,0:15:46.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Man, this one again?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.25,0:15:47.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.75,0:15:49.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.75,0:15:51.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Explosion!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.21,0:16:06.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,The temperature is supposed to\Nbe way cooler than yesterday.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.67,0:16:10.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, I forgot my hat today!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.25,0:16:13.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, I brought an extra!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.38,0:16:16.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.75,0:16:17.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's cute.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.88,0:16:20.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get changed.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.00,0:16:20.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.58,0:16:23.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.00,0:16:29.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're sure it's okay for me to\Ntell you to do stuff today?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.92,0:16:31.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.13,0:16:35.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ugh, when are you gonna stop being 'nice' to us?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.54,0:16:37.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you need another lecture?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.96,0:16:40.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just tell us what you want us to do, okay?!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.38,0:16:44.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, so...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.42,0:16:50.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Today, I want to cosplay my way,\Nand I want you all to do it with me!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.96,0:16:57.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lemon and Lime are Luc and Luka today!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.08,0:17:01.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be Number One\Nfor the second day in a row!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.46,0:17:05.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, Lemon, I didn't know you\Ncared that much about the ranking.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.25,0:17:08.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, only because they gave us 2 and 3!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.50,0:17:11.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're gonna earn that top spot this year...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.21,0:17:16.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.29,0:17:17.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.21,0:17:19.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-is this okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.63,0:17:24.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone's looking at me like I'm the girl\Nwho caused a bunch of drama yesterday.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.25,0:17:28.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're being paranoid!\NEveryone said they were excited to get our pics!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.63,0:17:29.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.71,0:17:34.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's always a handful of people who will judge you,\Neven if you don't do anything.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.42,0:17:37.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You only notice them when\Nyou're feeling bad about something.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.21,0:17:39.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just forget they even exist.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.29,0:17:42.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course Mikarin knows how to deal with this.\NShe's been on TV.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.21,0:17:46.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forget all that and just have fun!\NSummer Comiket only comes once a year!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.96,0:17:52.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right!\NI'm super excited to try to do this your way!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.00,0:18:13.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.88,0:18:15.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.63,0:18:17.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.13,0:18:19.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You were so gallant yesterday, Nonoa-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.46,0:18:21.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikarin!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.75,0:18:23.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ariel, you're so adorable!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.88,0:18:34.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's begin.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.50,0:18:41.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll start with their group pose from Volume 1.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.67,0:18:51.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Once we've looked through the crowd,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.33,0:18:54.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,we go to the next pose,\NVolume 1's special attack.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.96,0:18:56.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,This pose quality is incredible...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.29,0:18:58.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Their victory pose!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.38,0:19:02.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,How'd they get this good in one day?!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.63,0:19:04.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Moving into Volume 2.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.29,0:19:07.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,They've got more poses?!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.13,0:19:09.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,The guys in front haven't even left yet!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.88,0:19:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,There are tons of people behind us!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.54,0:19:14.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's this huge crowd? It's not even noon yet!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.54,0:19:21.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Great to have competition, huh...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.54,0:19:27.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're not gonna be able to see my target.\NAre they doing okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.67,0:19:37.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's not important anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.54,0:19:44.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,When you're cosplaying from the heart,\Nyou don't need to worry about a thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.33,0:19:53.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It feels like I'm living in a dream.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.25,0:19:57.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,A girl your age, playing dress-up?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.17,0:20:00.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,When I'm alone,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.63,0:20:04.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,it's easy to fall out of character\Nand remember my sad reality...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.58,0:20:08.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, not right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.54,0:20:13.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Liliel-sama?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.46,0:20:15.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Worn out already, Liliel?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.08,0:20:17.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Rest, then! I got this!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.63,0:20:20.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not when I have my friends by my side.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.88,0:20:27.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on all three of you today,\NNokiel, Miriella, Ariel.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.29,0:20:32.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our hearts are in this!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.67,0:20:37.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I found other people like me.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.71,0:20:41.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,My dreams have become reality.\NAll my worries have disappeared.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.54,0:20:44.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm cosplaying with my friends.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.00,0:20:49.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,And our only purpose is to express our overflowing love.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.88,0:20:55.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,That love brings the world of the\Nmanga to life right here, right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.71,0:20:59.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I couldn't be happier.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:04.92,0:21:07.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I dunno if we're taking number one today.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.25,0:21:09.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't give up yet, Lime!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.63,0:21:11.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're taking a five-minute break!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.71,0:21:15.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.54,0:21:19.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think I get why you cosplay this way.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.50,0:21:21.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,For a split second,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.17,0:21:26.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,it felt like I was really in\Nthe world of my dad's manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.79,0:21:29.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ririsa.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.58,0:21:36.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I should be thanking you guys,\Nfor teaching me how to be a good friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.04,0:21:45.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know now that sacrificing yourself for\Nyour friends isn't what friendship is about.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.29,0:21:52.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I also know how great it feels when\Nyour friends give their all to help you.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.75,0:22:01.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,My heart just feels so light and happy.\NI'm having so much fun cosplaying in a group.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.75,0:22:07.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I got to come to Comiket with you guys.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.17,0:22:14.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Save your tears for later, Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.25,0:22:16.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's right! We've still got this afternoon!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.38,0:22:18.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,The fun's just getting started!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.75,0:22:20.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.04,0:02:37.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(281.6,403.2)}{\an7}The World We Create with Our Friends
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.29,0:03:52.00,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,57.6)}{\an7}Cosplay Perfectionist
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:58.79,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(192,72)}{\an7}Liliel's Pure Mythril Bento Box Set
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.13,0:09:33.75,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(499.2,172.8)}{\an7}Cosplay Roundup
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.46,0:09:38.21,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(268.8,388.8)}{\an7}Real twin cosplayers aim for the Heavenly Seat
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.79,0:09:40.75,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(281.6,388.8)}{\an7}Lemon and Lime draw biggest crowd of Day 1
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.54,0:09:44.04,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(115.2,388.8)}{\an7}Nagomi's industry booth appearance draws her biggest crowd yet
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:50.25,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(422.4,324)}{\an7}No Mayura-sama this year...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:50.25,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(358.4,374.4)}{\an7}Are Lemon/Lime next up for Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.42,0:14:54.58,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(422.4,295.2)}{\an7}New follower:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.38,0:15:03.29,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(473.6,28.8)}{\an7}When Liliel passed out,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.38,0:15:03.29,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(396.8,79.2)}{\an7}Nokiel carried her off in her arms...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.38,0:15:03.29,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(396.8,129.6)}{\an7}Just like a scene from the manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.29,0:15:04.46,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(230.4,201.6)}{\an7}I feel bad but omg my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.29,0:15:04.46,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(230.4,352.8)}{\an7}Uhhhh did they give permission for you to take this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.29,0:15:04.46,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(230.4,496.8)}{\an7}they're reporting what happened idiot
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.71,0:15:10.13,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(678.4,129.6)}{\an7}Is Liliel-chan OK?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.71,0:15:10.13,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(371.2,201.6)}{\an7}I wanted to get your pic!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.71,0:15:10.13,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(345.6,252)}{\an7}Are you gonna be there tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.71,0:15:10.13,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(384,532.8)}{\an7}I'd love to get your group pic!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.63,0:15:15.54,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(115.2,93.6)}{\an7}NONOA @ Summer Comiket Day 1
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.63,0:15:15.54,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(409.6,252)}{\an7}Thank you for all your comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.63,0:15:15.54,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,360)}{\an7}Liliel-chan had heat exhaustion but she's okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.71,0:15:16.83,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(268.8,79.2)}{\an7}THANK GOD!!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.71,0:15:16.83,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.2,374.4)}{\an7}It was literally hell on earth today with that heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.71,0:15:16.83,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,424.8)}{\an7}Cosplayers were dropping like flies out there
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:19.00,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.2,374.4)}{\an7}It was literally hell on earth today with that heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:19.00,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,424.8)}{\an7}Cosplayers were dropping like flies out there
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.58,0:15:21.46,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(281.6,136.8)}{\an7}NONOA @ Summer Comiket Day 1
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.58,0:15:21.46,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(332.8,295.2)}{\an7}If she's still OK tomorrow we'll all be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.08,0:24:00.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(422.4,388.8)}{\an7}The Protagonist's Story
